1.4 Aims and Objectives
The study had the following aims:
• Characterise the external flow over the STeVe sounding rocket and CLV rocket using
CFD and semi-empirical methods.
• Compare the accuracy of various semi-empirical methods in determining aerodynamic
coefficients.
• Investigate the effects of aerodynamic heating on STeVe.
• Alter the geometry of the launch vehicles to reduce drag and heat transfer.
The study had the following objectives:
