software, referencing the RASAero user manual (Rogers and Cooper, 2019a).
Geometry Creation: RASAero has five input parts for geometry creation, which can all be
combined in different orders: Nose cone, body tube (fins), transition, fin canister, and boattail.
There are seven nose cone inputs: Conical, tangent ogive, Von Kármán ogive, power law, LV
